{:manifest/note "The v2 crafting datamine reference for RePoE fork 3.30.0.4.3, written by v2's `bb poe:datamine --raw <full download of 2026-11-28, the planner's> --out datamine` (indite.game.poe.datamine.fetch, rules games/poe/resources/poe/rules/datamine.edn, at v2 commit 6e6d065 on the branch claude/craft-c7c). Each mod that grants an effect (a support or a skill) the text names keeps :mod/grants ({:effect :level :name :line, :line being the line of the mod text that holds the effect markup, markup read as plain names), in RePoE's grants_effects order; hidden effects the text does not name are left out). Tests read it instead of downloading 55 MB of RePoE JSON. Regenerate it, never hand-edit it."
